<title>USA: Lehman's Guarnieri to head high yield research.</title>
<headline>Lehman's Guarnieri to head high yield research.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said on Tuesday it has appointed Michael Guarnieri as head of the High Yield Research Group in the firm's Global Fixed Income division.</p>
<p>Guarnieri, who currently is a high-yield analyst covering the manufacturing industry, will replace Joseph Amato, who has been named director of U.S. Equity Research for Lehman Brothers, the company said.</p>
<p>	  --Corporate bond unit, 212-859-1675</p>
